4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dFihyYkvtTsQ7kNvwFTRUzK&_nc_oc=AdoUhf6q44tqGgYNe9hvw_V5E4fy1IAzlIXLaFpCv0FNrT8X4_HH_YFO9l-xdzWMao0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCY4V0BMVFbl0K45H7pRZTgS1DnI89GljLvMimfkFgqgA&oe=6A68A8D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wj6WhemntJIQ7kNvwHSsFMc&_nc_oc=AdqB0yIkpbCNk5f6eYJG8a96ssOOe7HYVjqkGtx-gvycl8do3sKDEKeTCHy6r3XRV6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQALZyQx0j0JpyMk9wqst-_dFNggERfTWGuPfobokE6vWg&oe=6A68ADB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1Pghy3Lolo4Q7kNvwHFwEu-&_nc_oc=AdqKwS1aCFoOkDoPtZ6ss_6kAOy63-_vIlQt5oWaDTQ3Ki0ZhncspPCzcJoa-xeG8Io&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDcmCfHUFMXKxaHkDLk5Vk0o0XwXjRhtIYLshZKk324Lg&oe=6A68BB55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p